<title>FRANCE: Rhone suspended, new quote effort 0815 GMT.</title>
<headline>Rhone suspended, new quote effort 0815 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in France's Rhone-Poulenc were suspended limit-up at the open of the Paris bourse and a new attempt to requote will take place at 0815 GMT, the SBF stock markets association said.</p>
<p>The company said on Thursday it was considering launching a $25 billion bid to buy out the rest of unit Rhone-Poulenc Rorer and is due to hold a news conference at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>The new ceiling for attempting a requote at 0815 is 244.6 francs, an SBF spokeswoman said.</p>
